  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making Country Health Systems Stronger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Making Country Health Systems Stronger (MCHSS) programme aims to support countries to strengthen their health systems to accelerate progress towards Universal Health Coverage, resulting in more people, specifically the poor and vulnerable, having greater access to essential preventative, curative and rehabilitation health services with increased levels of financial risk protection.</narrative>
  </description>
